        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;\"><h2 style=\"color:#667eea;\">Subscription Cancelled</h2><p>We’re sorry to see you go. Your content access has been deactivated.</p><p>If you change your mind, you can resubscribe anytime:</p><p><a href=\"https://fiorsaoirse.com/#contact\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#667eea;color:white;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;\">Resubscribe</a></p><p>We’d love to hear your feedback — just reply to this email.</p><p>— The Fior Saoirse Team</p></div>",
